-- Limits in a metric space: convergence through open sets and through the
-- real sequence of distances to the limit, sequences agreeing eventually,
-- limits against closed balls, continuous images of convergent and Cauchy
-- sequences, and the closure of a set in metric terms
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
